  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "榴红区的宝可梦中心。\n在这里能够回复和治疗宝可梦，\n或购买和出售道具。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 1028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "69B47EA2533A76845B9D53EF68A64E2D5FC33002000A57288FD991CC80FD591F56DE590D548C6CBB75975B9D53EF68A6FF0C000A62168D2D4E70548C51FA552E9053517730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "汇聚在这里的店铺\n所售商品风格休闲且价格亲民。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 1100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C47805A57288FD991CC76845E9794FA000A6240552E554654C198CE683C4F1195F24E144EF7683C4EB26C1130020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这里汇聚了很多\n不被潮流左右，\n拥有独特价值观的店铺。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 1148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD991CC6C47805A4E865F88591A000A4E0D88AB6F6E6D415DE653F3FF0C000A62E5670972EC72794EF7503C89C276845E9794FA30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "历史璀璨的廊街，\n自很久以前便商铺林立。\n售卖豪华且高级的商品。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 1204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "538653F2748074A876845ECA8857FF0C000A81EA5F884E454EE5524D4FBF554694FA67977ACB3002000A552E53568C6A534E4E149AD87EA77684554654C130020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "历史悠久的廊街。\n汇聚在这里的店铺出售许多\n风格休闲且价格亲民的商品。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "538653F260A04E4576845ECA88573002000A6C47805A57288FD991CC76845E9794FA51FA552E8BB8591A000A98CE683C4F1195F24E144EF7683C4EB26C117684554654C130020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这条大道上分布着多间\n个性商品一应俱全的老字号店铺。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD96761592790534E0A52065E037740591A95F4000A4E2A6027554654C14E005E944FF15168768480015B5753F75E9794FA30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "最具规模的美术馆。\n部分藏品也会借给\n各个地区的美术馆。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6700517789C46A2176847F8E672F99863002000A90E8520685CF54C14E5F4F1A501F7ED9000A54044E2A5730533A76847F8E672F998630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "翡绿区的宝可梦中心。\n在这里能够回复和治疗宝可梦，\n或购买和出售道具。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7FE17EFF533A76845B9D53EF68A64E2D5FC33002000A57288FD991CC80FD591F56DE590D548C6CBB75975B9D53EF68A6FF0C000A62168D2D4E70548C51FA552E9053517730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "位于翡绿区的旅馆。\n可能是因为在巷子里，\n几乎没有客人。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F4D4E8E7FE17EFF533A768465C599863002000A53EF80FD662F56E04E3A57285DF75B5091CCFF0C000A51E04E4E6CA167095BA24EBA30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "宝可梦研究所。\n完成代理所长委托的调查内容，\n就能获得很棒的报酬。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B9D53EF68A678147A7662403002000A5B8C62104EE374066240957F59D4625876848C0367E551855BB9FF0C000A5C3180FD83B75F975F8868D2768462A5916C30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "一座位于卡洛斯地区\n中心——密阿雷市的塔。\n高度约３００米。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E005EA74F4D4E8E53616D1B65AF5730533A000A4E2D5FC3201420145BC6963F96F75E02768458543002000A9AD85EA67EA6FF13FF10FF107C7330020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "一座位于卡洛斯地区\n中心——密阿雷市的塔。\n里面曾有两千年前的装置。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E005EA74F4D4E8E53616D1B65AF5730533A000A4E2D5FC3201420145BC6963F96F75E02768458543002000A91CC976266FE67094E2453435E74524D768488C57F6E30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "由玛琪艾儿担任\n第二代所长的侦探事务所。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7531739B742A827E513F62C54EFB000A7B2C4E8C4EE36240957F76844FA663A24E8B52A1624030020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "推进密阿雷都市开发的\n外资企业——阔星公司的大楼。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "63A88FDB5BC6963F96F790FD5E025F0053D17684000A59168D444F014E1A201420149614661F516C53F876845927697C30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "基于社区进行施工的工程公司。\n该公司在各地设置了彩色螺丝，\n收集起来就能和他们交换东西。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "57FA4E8E793E533A8FDB884C65BD5DE576845DE57A0B516C53F83002000A8BE5516C53F85728540457308BBE7F6E4E865F69827287BA4E1DFF0C000A653696C68D7767655C3180FD548C4ED64EEC4EA463624E1C897F30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "位于翡绿区的广场。\n因为有多个水池，所以会吸引\n水属性的宝可梦聚集到这里。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F4D4E8E7FE17EFF533A76845E7F573A3002000A56E04E3A6709591A4E2A6C346C60FF0C62404EE54F1A54385F15000A6C345C5E602776845B9D53EF68A6805A96C652308FD991CC30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "作为都市开发计划的一环\n而建造的车站。连接机场与\n密阿雷市的列车会在这里停靠。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F5C4E3A90FD5E025F0053D18BA1521276844E0073AF000A800C5EFA902076848F667AD930028FDE63A5673A573A4E0E000A5BC6963F96F75E02768452178F664F1A57288FD991CC505C976030020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "以古代圆形剧场为基础打造，\n表现出与水和谐共生的广场。\n能感受到一种井然有序的美。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EE553E44EE357065F625267573A4E3A57FA784062539020FF0C000A886873B051FA4E0E6C34548C8C105171751F76845E7F573A3002000A80FD611F53D752304E0079CD4E95713667095E8F76847F8E30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "以独特的见解建造的建筑物，\n充满了异国风情。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EE572EC7279768489C189E35EFA902076845EFA7B517269FF0C000A51456EE14E865F0256FD98CE60C530020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "浦蓝区的宝可梦中心。\n在这里能够回复和治疗宝可梦，\n或购买和出售道具。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6D6684DD533A76845B9D53EF68A64E2D5FC33002000A57288FD991CC80FD591F56DE590D548C6CBB75975B9D53EF68A6FF0C000A62168D2D4E70548C51FA552E9053517730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "春日大道的宝可梦中心。\n在这里能够回复和治疗宝可梦，\n或购买和出售道具。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662565E55927905376845B9D53EF68A64E2D5FC33002000A57288FD991CC80FD591F56DE590D548C6CBB75975B9D53EF68A6FF0C000A62168D2D4E70548C51FA552E9053517730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "该广场以开放的空间设计为特征，\n中央的方尖碑十分显眼。\n是一个历史悠久的广场。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BE55E7F573A4EE55F00653E76847A7A95F48BBE8BA14E3A72795F81FF0C000A4E2D592E768465B95C16789153415206663E773C3002000A662F4E004E2A538653F260A04E4576845E7F573A30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "由于曾与某个组织有关联，\n所以现在还找不到买家的咖啡店。\n因外观和室内装修的颜色独特而出名。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75314E8E66FE4E0E67D04E2A7EC47EC7670951738054FF0C000A62404EE573B057288FD8627E4E0D52304E705BB67684549655615E973002000A56E0591689C2548C5BA4518588C54FEE7684989C827272EC7279800C51FA540D30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "蓉粉区的宝可梦中心。\n在这里能够回复和治疗宝可梦，\n或购买和出售道具。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "84C97C89533A76845B9D53EF68A64E2D5FC33002000A57288FD991CC80FD591F56DE590D548C6CBB75975B9D53EF68A6FF0C000A62168D2D4E70548C51FA552E9053517730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "粉色广场附近的宝可梦中心。\n在这里能够回复和治疗宝可梦，\n或购买和出售道具。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7C8982725E7F573A96448FD176845B9D53EF68A64E2D5FC33002000A57288FD991CC80FD591F56DE590D548C6CBB75975B9D53EF68A6FF0C000A62168D2D4E70548C51FA552E9053517730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "该广场由以栅栏分隔开的\n各个草地创作出的艺术为特征。\n也能享受从小塔望出去的景色。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 2748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BE55E7F573A75314EE56805680F520696945F007684000A54044E2A83495730521B4F5C51FA7684827A672F4E3A72795F813002000A4E5F80FD4EAB53D74ECE5C0F5854671B51FA53BB7684666F827230020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "正式名称为秀丽世大酒店。\n是位于北侧大道的高级旅馆。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 2832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6B635F0F540D79F04E3A79C04E3D4E16592791525E973002000A662F4F4D4E8E53174FA75927905376849AD87EA765C5998630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "榴红区的宝可梦中心。\n在这里能够回复和治疗宝可梦，\n或购买和出售道具。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 2888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "69B47EA2533A76845B9D53EF68A64E2D5FC33002000A57288FD991CC80FD591F56DE590D548C6CBB75975B9D53EF68A6FF0C000A62168D2D4E70548C51FA552E9053517730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "棱镜塔附近的宝可梦中心。\n在这里能够回复和治疗宝可梦，\n或购买和出售道具。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 2960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "68F1955C585496448FD176845B9D53EF68A64E2D5FC33002000A57288FD991CC80FD591F56DE590D548C6CBB75975B9D53EF68A6FF0C000A62168D2D4E70548C51FA552E9053517730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "该广场有一些摊位，\n且带有一种小集市的气氛，\n非常贴近平民，能让人感觉无拘无束。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BE55E7F573A67094E004E9B644A4F4DFF0C000A4E145E2667094E0079CD5C0F96C65E0276846C146C1BFF0C000A975E5E388D348FD15E736C11FF0C80FD8BA94EBA611F89C965E062D865E0675F30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不知道什么时候在\n琼黄区的角落开设的道场。\n对培育宝可梦很有见地。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D77E590534EC04E4865F650195728000A743C9EC4533A768489D2843D5F008BBE76849053573A3002000A5BF957F980B25B9D53EF68A65F88670989C1573030020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "琼黄区的宝可梦中心。\n在这里能够回复和治疗宝可梦，\n或购买和出售道具。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "743C9EC4533A76845B9D53EF68A64E2D5FC33002000A57288FD991CC80FD591F56DE590D548C6CBB75975B9D53EF68A6FF0C000A62168D2D4E70548C51FA552E9053517730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "冬日大道的宝可梦中心。\n在这里能够回复和治疗宝可梦，\n或购买和出售道具。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 3260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51AC65E55927905376845B9D53EF68A64E2D5FC33002000A57288FD991CC80FD591F56DE590D548C6CBB75975B9D53EF68A6FF0C000A62168D2D4E70548C51FA552E9053517730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "能够在这里更改发色和发型。\n提供免费修眉服务。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 3336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "80FD591F57288FD991CC66F4653953D18272548C53D1578B3002000A63D04F9B514D8D394FEE7709670D52A130020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "出售能让特定宝可梦\n进化的石头和超级石。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 3384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51FA552E80FD8BA972795B9A5B9D53EF68A6000A8FDB5316768477F35934548C8D857EA777F330020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "出售各类精灵球。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 3428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51FA552E54047C7B7CBE7075740330020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "出售头饰、腰包\n和耳饰等商品的店铺。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 3448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51FA552E59349970300181705305000A548C803399707B49554654C176845E9794FA30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "凡是能穿戴在身上的东西\n几乎应有尽有的高级店。\n但据说需要满足条件才能入内。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 3488,
