      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 85,
      "offsetInSection": 5668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530055004200410054004F004D004900434E1353565E9730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "专卖SUBATOMIC的商品，且有\n红、黑、白、蓝４种颜色可供选择的店铺。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 86,
      "offsetInSection": 5696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E13535600530055004200410054004F004D004900437684554654C1FF0C4E146709000A7EA230019ED13001767D300184DDFF1479CD989C827253EF4F9B900962E976845E9794FA30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "出售YASHIO SHIRO商品的店铺。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 87,
      "offsetInSection": 5772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51FA552E00590041005300480049004F00200053004800490052004F554654C176845E9794FA30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "出售设计个性十足的服装。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 88,
      "offsetInSection": 5816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51FA552E8BBE8BA14E2A602753418DB37684670D88C530020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "出售运动服和\n鞋子等商品的店铺。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 89,
      "offsetInSection": 5844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51FA552E8FD052A8670D548C000A978B5B507B49554654C176845E9794FA30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "出售设计个性十足的\n鞋子和袜子。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 90,
      "offsetInSection": 5880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51FA552E8BBE8BA14E2A602753418DB37684000A978B5B50548C889C5B5030020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "出售头饰、腰包\n和耳饰等商品的店铺。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 91,
      "offsetInSection": 5916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51FA552E59349970300181705305000A548C803399707B49554654C176845E9794FA30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因追求一流的态度\n而备受好评的\n二星级餐厅。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 92,
      "offsetInSection": 5956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E08FFD6C424E006D41768460015EA6000A800C590753D7597D8BC47684000A4E8C661F7EA79910538530020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "以前采用会员制，\n但随着在别的地区开设分店，\n现在成了谁都能来享受的店铺。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 93,
      "offsetInSection": 6004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EE5524D91C775284F1A54585236FF0C000A4F46968F77405728522B76845730533A5F008BBE52065E97FF0C000A73B0572862104E868C0190FD80FD67654EAB53D776845E9794FA30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "套餐深受好评，\n被认为是值得一访的\n三星级餐厅。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 94,
      "offsetInSection": 6080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "595799106DF153D7597D8BC4FF0C000A88AB8BA44E3A662F503C5F974E008BBF7684000A4E09661F7EA79910538530020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "密阿雷下水道的出入口。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 95,
      "offsetInSection": 6132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BC6963F96F74E0B6C349053768451FA516553E330020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在这家咖啡馆里客人会\n就宝可梦与人的牵绊进行热烈讨论，\n但却感受不到客人之间的牵绊。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 96,
      "offsetInSection": 6156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "57288FD95BB654965561998691CC5BA24EBA4F1A000A5C315B9D53EF68A64E0E4EBA768472757ECA8FDB884C70ED70C88BA88BBAFF0C000A4F465374611F53D74E0D52305BA24EBA4E4B95F4768472757ECA30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "认为登峰造极就是要单点突破，\n仅以１款绝顶咖啡来决胜负的咖啡馆。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 97,
      "offsetInSection": 6244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BA44E3A767B5CF0902067815C31662F8981535570B97A817834FF0C000A4EC54EE5FF116B3E7EDD987654965561676551B380DC8D1F768454965561998630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这里以前会有训练家宣传片爱好者\n聚集而来，现在则有很多为重拍照片\n而想要追加点餐的客人。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 98,
      "offsetInSection": 6312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD991CC4EE5524D4F1A67098BAD7EC35BB65BA34F2072477231597D8005000A805A96C6800C6765FF0C73B05728521967095F88591A4E3A91CD62CD71677247000A800C60F389818FFD52A070B9991076845BA24EBA30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "对宝可梦对战有讲究的客人\n会聚集在这间咖啡馆各抒己见，\n进行唇枪舌战。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 99,
      "offsetInSection": 6404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BF95B9D53EF68A65BF9621867098BB27A7676845BA24EBA000A4F1A805A96C657288FD995F4549655619986540462925DF189C1FF0C000A8FDB884C550767AA820C621830020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因讲究咖啡的煎培手法，且会向\n囊中羞涩的人免费提供咖啡，\n而在最近成为话题的店铺。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 100,
      "offsetInSection": 6476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E08BB27A76549655617684714E57F9624B6CD5FF0C4E144F1A5411000A56CA4E2D7F9E6DA976844EBA514D8D3963D04F9B54965561FF0C000A800C572867008FD162104E3A8BDD989876845E9794FA30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "新咖啡的２号店。\n讲究咖啡的煎培手法，且会向\n囊中羞涩的人免费提供咖啡。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 101,
      "offsetInSection": 6560,
